//! entry `0x80083B30` and the wave-123 entry `0x80096700`: they are 4-byte
//! branch thunks, and their one-call wrappers are written out because each is
//! the last open entry of its bucket.
//! The wave-4 batch adds the
//! BG-unit model (`0x80083380..0x80083BD0`), two camera edge tests, the spatial
//! list (`0x8008D3D0..0x8008DDB0`) and the course-section accessors
