///   `+0x1C`/`+0x20` truncated to 16-bit; calls `0x801C8E70`, `0x801C5960`,
///   `0x801C59D0`, `0x801C5F40`, `0x800E48A0`, `0x801C5EC0`, `0x801C6290`,
///   `0x801C4F70`, `0x801C76C0`.
