/// Forwards a step to the virtual method at slot `+0x14`.
///
/// The object at `this` begins with a vtable pointer; the original loads
/// `[this][0x14]` and tail-calls it with the object still in `r3`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_800878d0` at `0x800878D0` (16 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/800878d0_FUN_800878d0.c`
/// - observed: `(**(code **)(*param_1 + 0x14))();` with "could not recover
///   jumptable", so the call keeps the unchanged `r3`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: object whose first word points at its vtable.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be readable and `[this]+0x14` must hold a callable address.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - the slot is explicit; the callee signature is an unrecovered
/// indirect jump.
pub unsafe fn fn_800878d0(this: usize) {
    call_vtable_slot1(this, 0x14);
}

