/// Builds the course capture manager and all of its subobjects.
///
/// The 0xA0-byte object starts with an embedded allocator at `+4`; this
/// function creates the two effect subobjects at `+0x20`/`+0x98`, two stage
/// blocks at `+0x24`/`+0x28`, the spawn blocks at `+0x34`/`+0x38`, the
/// letterbox/scissor object at `+0x3C`, twelve effect wrappers at `+0x40`,
/// two depth buffers at `+0x70`/`+0x74`, the optional scissor at `+0x7C`, and
/// the second set of block subobjects at `+0x80..+0x94`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_800892f0` at `0x800892F0` (2056 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/800892f0_FUN_800892f0.c`
/// - observed: `0x8016A960(+4,0xC000,...)`; `0x80081BE0(1,0x2A,1)` gates the
///   `+0x98` block; `0x800872E0` supplies the spawn depth; the depth-of-field
///   choice is `0x80089030`; stage type `0` writes `7750.0f` at `+0x24`,
///   `r13-0x5860` at `+0x28`, and clears bit 0 of the capture byte.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: capture manager; `this+4` is the embedded allocator.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Allocates and constructs every capture subobject and loads
/// `dof/shimmer.bti` plus the per-stage depth-of-field file.
///
/// # Safety
/// Allocators and the archive manager must be live; `this+4..+0x97` must be
/// writable.
