///   `(0.5*x, -0.5*x, -0.5*x, 0.5*x, 3600, 20000)`; `0x801C9C10` takes
///   `(3600, height+32, x, x, 3600, 1)`; `0x802BE580` is called twice with the
///   same eight colour floats.
