/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80075750_FUN_80075750.c`
/// - observed: `if (*(int *)(unaff_r13 + -0x58d4) == 2)` then two word copies
///   from `r13-0x58d0` / `r13-0x58cc` and `return 1;`.
