/// Links a scroll layer at the head of the global scroll-layer list.
///
/// A layer whose `+0xDC` byte is already set is returned from immediately, so
/// the insert is idempotent. Otherwise the layer becomes the new head; when the
/// list was empty it also becomes the tail, and when it was not, `+0x08` is
/// spliced in front of the previous head's own `+0x08` link.
