/// Normalises an angle word by subtracting `0x4000` steps.
///
/// When the word exceeds `0x3FFF`, subtracts `0x4000` and decrements the
/// count from `(word >> 14) & 3` until zero, then returns the low halfword
/// as a sign-extended value.
