///   *(int *)(&DAT_802ef598 + (uint)*(byte *)(param_1 + 0xa4) * 4))`, then the
///   `+0xA4`/`+0xA0` stores, then `if (*(char *)(param_1 + 0xa4) == '\x03')`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: entry object.
/// - `candidate`: packed tag/candidate word.
///
