/// Forwards two arguments to `0x80157310` when the scene object exists.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_800b3780` at `0x800B3780` (32 bytes)
/// - Extent: `0x800B3780..0x800B37A0` (32 bytes), tail `b 0x80157310` at `0x800B379C`.
