/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/800b88d0_FUN_800b88d0.c`
/// - observed: the five literal table stores, `local_18[5] = DAT_802f0cf4;`,
///   the `*(int *)(param_1 + 0x1c)` index and the two stores.
///
/// # Arguments
