///   output word) / `C0029148 lfs f0,-0x6EB8(r2)` (`0.0f`) /
///   `FC010040 fcmpo cr0,f1,f0` / `7C600026 mfcr r3` /
///   `54630FFE rlwinm r3,r3,1,31,31` (the `cr0.lt` bit); epilogue.
