/// Performs one state-transition call and latches the event flag.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_800967a0` at `0x800967A0` (76 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/800967a0_FUN_800967a0.c`
