/// Refreshes the ground-contact block of the `Wm` actor.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80096f60` at `0x80096F60` (236 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80096f60_FUN_80096f60.c`
