/// Applies the depth-driven camera panel offset with the two travel limits.
///
/// The input delta is the player's `+0x1530` height minus the owner's
/// `+0x90060`. The travel range is `scale * owner[+0x8FE7C]` minus the two
/// stored offsets `+0x8FE54`/`+0x8FE58`; the accumulator at `+0x8FE48` is
/// stepped by the delta and then clamped to that range.
