/// Initialises the node list owned by `this` and fills its four children.
///
/// The order is: the shared allocator setup `0x8016A960` (handle `-1`, heap
/// [`TILE_HEAP`], alignment `0x20`), the child builder `0x800B9300`, the
/// per-child fill `0x800B94C0`, then the matching allocator finish
/// `0x8016A9B0`.
