/// - observed: `if (*(int *)(param_1 + 0x770) == 2) return param_1 + 0x824;`,
///   the `== 3` arm returning `param_1 + 0x850`, and
///   `return param_1 + 0x668;`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: owner object; the mode word is at `+0x770`.
