/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80078540` at `0x80078540` (152 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80078540_FUN_80078540.c`
/// - observed: the `FUN_8005fc70()` mask, the `iVar3 < 4` loop with
///   `FUN_8005f900(iVar3)`, the `uVar1 & 0xff & 1 << iVar3` test and the
