/// Runs one ground query and tells the caller whether the actor is grounded.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80097700` at `0x80097700` (104 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80097700_FUN_80097700.c`
