///   *(undefined1 *)(param_1 + 0x38f),0)`; then
///   `bVar1 = iVar2 - 1U < 2;` and, when true, the virtual call at
///   `*(param_1 + 0x60) + 0x21c`; the function returns `bVar1`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: actor; `+0x38F` is the probe's flag byte and `+0x60` its vtable.
/// - `point`: two `f32` values (x, y) handed to the ground probe.
///
