/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_800c1070` at `0x800C1070` (64 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/800c1070_FUN_800c1070.c`
/// - observed: `if ((param_1 != 0) && (0 < param_2)) { FUN_802b9280(); }
///   return param_1;`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: object to release; may be null.
/// - `owned`: positive when the object must also be freed.
///
/// # Returns
