///   copies, `param_3[0x19] = (float)param_1;` and `param_3[0x1a] =
///   (float)param_2;`, `iVar1 = FUN_802b9210(0x10);`,
///   `uVar2 = FUN_800e2ad0(iVar1,10,8,0);` and the twenty
///   `param_3[N] = uVar2;` stores.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `first`: value stored at `+0x64`.
/// - `second`: value stored at `+0x68`.
/// - `this`: record to build.
/// - `source`: three-word source vector.
///
/// # Returns
/// `this`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Allocates one child object and writes the record.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be writable for `0x6C` bytes and `source` readable for twelve.
///
/// # Confidence
