/// Tears down a larger stage-element object, including its `+0x2B0` interface.
///
/// The `+0x2B0` sub-object is reset to vtable `0x80329958`, released and
/// deleted, the `+0x278` interface is detached, and the remaining chain is the
/// same as [`fn_800b7c50`]: base vtable `0x803158D8`, the two linked
/// sub-objects, the `+0x48` detach, the `+8` clear and an optional free.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_800b7db0` at `0x800B7DB0` (240 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/800b7db0_FUN_800b7db0.c`
