/// Converts one signed 20.12 fixed-point word to a world coordinate.
///
/// observed: the original builds `CONCAT44(0x43300000, word ^ 0x80000000)`,
/// subtracts the `2^52 + 2^31` double at `0x8042BC48` and divides by the
/// `4096.0f` at `0x8042BC74`; that is exactly `(word as i32) as f32 / 4096.0`.
///
