///   `FUN_802dc9a0(param_1 + 0x900ac,&DAT_80077390,FUN_800773a0,0x1c,2);`,
///   the `iVar5 = 2` / `iVar4 += 0xa0` double loop of 40 `uVar2` stores,
///   `*(int *)(unaff_r13 + -0x58b0) = param_1;` and
///   `return param_1;`.
