/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8009f630` at `0x8009F630` (84 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8009f630_FUN_8009f630.c`
/// - observed: `(**(code **)(*(int *)(param_1 + 0x60) + 0x3ec))(param_1,8);`
///   then `cVar1 = (**(code **)(*(int *)(param_1 + 0x60) + 1000))(param_1);`
///   and `return (int)cVar1;`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: actor whose `+0x60` vtable carries the two model slots.
///
/// # Returns
/// The sign-extended byte returned by the `+0x3E8` slot.
///
