/// Two virtual calls; the first arms slot `8`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this + 0x60` must be a live vtable with callable `+0x3EC`/`+0x3E8` slots.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - both slot numbers, the `8` and the sign extension are literal.
