const E283_F_695C_ZERO: usize = SDA2_BASE - 0x695C;

/// Re-initialises the wire-mesh ("kanaami") strip model of one object.
///
/// Clears the three blend floats at `+0x68..+0x74`, stores the new angle at
/// `+0x11C` (`sth`), rebuilds the projection columns ([`fn_800bbe10`]), rebuilds
/// and rebinds the strip model ([`fn_800bbd30`]), runs the empty base hook
/// [`fn_800bbf00`] and finally re-registers the model handle at `+0x28` through
/// `0x8016A000(this + 0x28, this)`.
///
/// This is the `+0x10` (re-init) entry of the strip model's vtable: the
/// staleness check at `0x800BC020` calls it after comparing the cached `+0x1C`
/// stream word with the live HF-stream singleton.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: none - no `functions.tsv` row for `0x800BBF10`.
/// - Extent: `0x800BBF10..0x800BBF6C` (92 bytes, 23 words), ending at the `blr`
///   at `0x800BBF68`; one zero word fills `0x800BBF6C..0x800BBF70` and the next
///   body starts at `0x800BBF70`.
