///   `FUN_800bf7d0(uVar1,&local_80,param_3,param_4);`,
///   `FUN_800bf970(uVar1,&local_b0,param_5);` and `FUN_802dcdb8();`.
/// - Removed: the modelled `_restgpr_25` epilogue call (`0x802DCDB8`).
///   it only restores registers.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: lift object.
/// - `position`: three readable floats.
/// - `columns`, `rows`: raw counts for [`fn_800bf7d0`].
/// - `mask`: bit mask for [`fn_800bf970`].
/// - `angle`: rotation angle.
///
