///   `&DAT_802ef638 + ((uVar10 ± 1) * 4 & 0xc)` rows, the `0x4000` quarter-turn
///   folds, the `local_8c < param_4[1]` best-height test and the
///   `FUN_8006d120((double)param_3[1], local_a8)` loop advance.
/// - observed: the flat-arm box test uses strict `<` and reads `+0x74` where
///   [`fn_80073290`] uses `<=` and `+0x64`.
