/// - `actor`: moving object; `+0xC2` receives the contact angle.
/// - `entry`: scroll-layer entry; `+0xC8` is the circle mode, `+0xBC` the kind.
/// - `point`: three-float probe point (read only here).
/// - `out_normal`: three-float normal destination.
///
/// # Returns
/// `1` when a contact was recorded, `0` otherwise.
