/// Builds the sixteen effect instances of the stage effect table.
///
/// The camera block from `0x80164B30` is sampled once (`0x80253990` for the
/// three-float origin, `0x802540B0` for the eight colour floats and `0x80253E60`
/// for six further words), and the 48-byte transform is rebuilt for every
/// instance from those eight floats. Instances `3`, `2`, `6` and `4` are
/// unconditional; `1`, `0` and `5` need bit 0 of the `r13-0x5986` mode byte
/// clear; and each of the four player slots contributes an id `0xB + slot` and
/// an id `7 + slot` when `0x80061080(slot)` returns zero.
