/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80093530` at `0x80093530` (1312 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80093530_FUN_80093530.c`
/// - observed: the `FUN_800b3b50(0xffffffff) == 0` gate, the three camera
///   samplers, the sixteen `FUN_802be580` + `FUN_8016c830` pairs with the ids
///   `3,2,6,1,0xB..0xE,0,7..0xA,5,4`, the `(*(byte *)(r13 - 0x5986) & 1)` tests,
///   the `FUN_80061080(iVar1) == 0` tests and the final `+0x5787 = 1` store.
