/// Draws the tile window of one BG scene layer, one cell at a time.
///
/// The pass first builds the layer transform (three angle/scale doubles into a
/// 0x30-byte matrix, composed with `block`), then walks `rows × columns` cells.
/// Each cell's `u16` value is fetched from the tile table with the layer's
/// `+0x909C8` mode selecting one of four offsets (`0`, `0x4E`, `0x10E`,
/// `0x1CA`), masked with `0x3FF`, and submitted through `0x8010A6C0` when it
/// passes the layer filter.
///
