// * `0x800A7890` `blr` at `0x800A78C4` -> `0x34 + 4 = 56`;
// * `0x800A8170` tail `b 0x800B8850` at `0x800A8174` -> `8` (no frame, the
//   body ends in the branch, so `8` is the real extent and not an artefact);
// * `0x800A8730`, `0x800A8740`, `0x800A87F0`, `0x800A8800`
//   `lis`/`addi`/`blr` -> `12` each;
// * `0x800A9550` `blr` at `0x800A9710` -> `0x1C0 + 4 = 452`;
// * `0x800AA400` `blr` at `0x800AA478` -> `0x74 + 4 = 124`;
// * `0x800AA6A0` `blr` at `0x800AA72C` -> `0x8C + 4 = 144`;
// * `0x800AA7B0` `blr` at `0x800AA7EC` -> `0x3C + 4 = 64`.
//
// No `functions.tsv` size in this lane is a prologue artefact.
//
// ## Constants reused from earlier lanes
//
// `W84_TYPE_INFO` (`0x80377A04`), `W92_F_SAMPLE_X` (`r2 - 0x63F8`),
// `W69_F_SAMPLE_Y` (`r2 - 0x63F4`), `W69_G_NOTICE_OWNER` (`r13 - 0x5630`),
// `W38_ANGLE_CONV` (`0x801611C0`), `COLLISION_AREA_UNREGISTER`
// (`0x8008C380`), `FN_800E20A0_F` (`0x800E20A0`), `FN_801662F0_A223`
// (`0x801662F0`), `call2_f64_i16`, `call1_f64_ptr2`, `SDA_BASE` and
// `SDA2_BASE` already live in this module and are reused unchanged. Only the
// callees, the sdata2 slots and the `0x802F0900` record below are new,
// suffixed `_A224`.

