// 0x800A7690
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Submits a three-float position as kind `0x237`.
///
/// The stack block is `{position[0], position[1], 480.0f}`: the first two
/// components are copied straight out of the caller's pair and the third is the
/// `r2 - 0x6CA8` constant. The whole block is then handed to `0x80064610` as
/// `(0x237, 1, &block, 0, 0)`. The incoming `this` register is unused: `r3` is
/// overwritten with the literal `0x237` before the call.
