/// - observed: `local_10 = *(undefined4 *)(unaff_r2 + -0x6ca8);`,
///   `local_14 = param_2[1];`, `local_18 = *param_2;` and
///   `FUN_80064610(0x237,1,&local_18,0,0);`.
/// - extent: `stwu r1,-0x20` at `0x800A7690` through `bclr` at `0x800A76D8` =
///   76 bytes, exactly the `functions.tsv` size.
