/// Byte-identical twin of [`fn_800aa850`]: same `+0xAF0` `+0x04` handle, same
/// `{+0xAC, +0xB0, 5500.0f}` record, same five-argument `0x8016C890` submit.
///
/// The two entries sit two vtable slots apart (21 and 23) in the
/// `0x80314534` table, with the `+0xAF4` virtual variant `0x800AA8B0` between
