///   `bl 0x8016C890` (`0x480C1F29`, target `0x8016C890`).
/// - `r2 - 0x6C44` is the same `5500.0f` slot (`0x8042C43C`, word
///   `0x45ABE000`), i.e. the existing [`W224B_F_5500`].
///
/// # Arguments
