///   `+0xEC` is `r2 - 0x6C20` = `6.5f`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: actor with the `+0x600`/`+0x604`/`+0x644` animation triple, the
///   `+0x60` vtable, a linked collision area at `+0x79C` and the
///   `+0xE8..+0x120` state block.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One entry lookup/bind pair with two rates, one virtual call, one collision
/// unlink, four `f32` stores and two state-field resets.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this + 0x600 .. this + 0x648`, `this + 0x75C .. this + 0x760`,
/// `this + 0x79C .. this + 0x7A0` and `this + 0xE8 .. this + 0x124` must be
