// 0x800AD090
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Tears the actor's vertical state down: releases the animation track bound to
/// the `+0x75C` slot `1`, unlinks the collision area and resets the motion
/// fields.
///
/// Order of operations, guarded exactly where the original guards:
///
/// 1. When `[[this + 0x75C] + 0x04] != 0` the name handle `[this + 0x75C][0]`
///    is resolved through `0x8023A0B0` against the animation owner at
///    `this + 0x600`; the 4-byte result is parked on the stack and
///    `0x801651F0(this + 0x644, this + 0x604, &handle, 0)` files it. Then
///    `0x80169F80(0.0f, this + 0x604, this + 0x644)` and
///    `0x801680E0(1.0f, this + 0x644)` detach it.
/// 2. Virtual slot `0x98` of the `+0x60` vtable runs on `this`.
/// 3. The collision area at `this + 0x79C` is unlinked by `0x8008C380`.
/// 4. `+0x114 = -0.275f`, `+0xE8 = +0xF0 = 0.0f`, `+0xEC = 6.5f` and bit 3 of
///    the `+0x120` flag word is cleared.
