///   as `double`; the loads are `lfs`, and both callees take a single-precision
///   value in `f1`, so the body widens the `f32` load to `f64` for the call.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the actor being torn down.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One name resolution, one track bind, two track detaches, one virtual call,
/// one collision unlink and five field writes.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be a live actor with a `+0x75C` array whose element `1` is
/// readable, a `+0x60` vtable with slot `0x98`, and a linked collision area at
/// `+0x79C`.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - every branch, slot, offset and constant is literal; the four float
/// literals and both table entries were read out of the image.
