//
// ## How the extents were measured
//
// `grep`-free recursive descent from each entry: follow take/fall-through of
// every conditional branch and the fall-through of every `bl`, stop on `bclr`
// and `bcctr` with `BO = 20` (unconditional return / tail call) and on
// unconditional `b` (tail call). The highest address reached is the extent. It
// agrees to the byte with the nine `functions.tsv`-sized neighbours and with
// every one of the doc's 22 entries, which is why it is used for the 65 here.
//
// ## What the class looks like
//
// Everything below shares the field map the wave-224/225 lanes already
// established for this actor:
//
// * `+0x60` - vtable pointer of the class itself (slots `+0xD4`..`+0x5E0` here;
//   far wider than this 68-slot table, which is a *different* interface);
// * `+0xAC`/`+0xB0`/`+0xB4` - position `x`/`y`/`z`;
// * `+0xE8`/`+0xF4`/`+0x11C` - vertical speed, bounce speed, approach rate;
// * `+0x544` - embedded "motion/sound" node (vtable at `+0x544`, slots
//   `+0x30`/`+0x34` play the entry id with `(s16)+0x5F0` as the arg);
// * `+0x5F0` - a signed halfword forwarded to every motion-slot call;
// * `+0x604`/`+0x644`/`+0x6AC` - the three animation nodes of the wave-223/224
//   resource family (`+0x604` model block, `+0x644` animation, `+0x6AC` the
//   secondary track);
// * `+0x6A8` - the handle last returned by `0x8023A200`;
// * `+0x760` - pointer to the four-handle resource set (`+0x04`, `+0x08`,
//   `+0x0C`, `+0x10`);
// * `+0xAF0` - pointer to the resolved effect-handle set (`+0x00`..`+0x48`);
// * `+0xAF4`, `+0xC1C`, `+0xD44` - the three embedded effect emitters, all
//   called through their `+0xA0` slot with `(self, handle, 0, position, 0, 0)`;
// * `+0xAE4`/`+0xAE8`/`+0xAD8`/`+0xADC` - the two three-float effect anchor
//   pairs;
// * `+0xE6C` - pointer to the 8-byte `{id, frame}` effect-entry array, where
//   `id == 0x449` marks an unused slot.
//
// `// inferred:` the slot *names* below (position copy, bound scale, resource
// bind, teardown step...) follow from the callees and from the neighbouring
// translated bodies; no symbol names them. Every offset, id, slot and float
// constant is literal in `main.elf`.
// ===========================================================================

