///   tree has no file for it; the body was read from `work/dol/main.elf`.
/// - Extent: `0x800A8FA0..0x800A8FBC` (28 bytes); the closing `bclr 20,0` is
///   `0x4E800020` at `0x800A8FB8` and `0x800A8FBC` is the four zero pad bytes
///   before `0x800A8FC0`.
