///   `stfs f2,0x0(r3)` / `stfs f1,0x4(r3)` / `stfs f0,0x8(r3)` / `bclr`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `out` - destination record (twelve writable bytes).
/// * `source` - actor whose position triple is read.
