/// Calls a `f1`-first function with two pointer arguments.
///
/// `0x80169F80(scale, block, node)` keeps its scalar in `f1` and both pointers
/// in `r3`/`r4`; [`platform`] has no such helper and the integer-only
/// [`platform::call3`] would drop the scalar.
