/// instruction-for-instruction identical to [`fn_800a16a0`] (`0x800A16A0`,
/// 380 bytes): every opcode, operand, table address and constant matches, and
/// only the PC-relative branch displacements differ
/// (`work/wave253/b/disasm.txt` against `work/wave253/b/cmp.txt`). The body
/// therefore forwards to the already-audited translation instead of carrying a
/// second copy.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: none - no `functions.tsv` row and no export file for `0x800A1470`.
/// - Extent: 380 bytes, `0x800A1470..0x800A15EC`; 12 zero bytes precede it and
///   4 zero bytes follow, then slot 91 at `0x800A15F0`.
