///   `+0x16C`).
/// - observed: the four-slot `0x8005F900` loop with `0x80162D00` and
///   `0x8012E510`, the `+0x60`/`+0x98` virtual, the `+0x274`/`+0xE8..+0x11C`/
///   `+0x459` store run, the `+0x102` sign test with the `0x8042C1A4` seed
///   table, the `+0x428`/`+0x431` effect pair and the `+0x391` choice of
///   `-384.0f`/`4500.0f` at `+0xB4`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor with the `+0x60` state vtable and the `+0x414..+0x459`
///   parameter block.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// As [`fn_800a16a0`]: at most one re-parent call, one virtual call, two effect
/// spawns and seventeen field writes.
///
/// # Safety
/// As [`fn_800a16a0`]; the four player objects, if present, must be readable at
/// `+0x2A78`.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the two instruction streams are identical word-for-word apart from
/// branch displacements; delegation reuses the audited twin.
pub unsafe fn fn_800a1470(this: usize) {
    fn_800a16a0(this);
}

