/// Four-state die stepper selected by `+0x360`: it ticks the `+0x544` motion
/// object and then runs the fall, land, bounce or smoke arm.
///
/// The four arms, in order:
///
/// 1. State `1` advances the `+0x102` animation channel by `0x1000`, decrements
///    the `+0xD1C` hold counter, and on reaching zero advances to state `2` and
///    - when the owner's `+0x5F8` record word `+4` is not positive - re-binds
///    `0x80357AB4` on the owner plus `0x80357F9C` on `this`.
/// 2. State `2` folds `+0xD14` into `+0x102`, ticks the actor, posts event
///    `0x5AC` with the `+0xAC` point, and compares the `+0xD18` timer against
///    `45.0f`. On equality it re-binds `0x803579B4`, reloads `+0xD14` from the
///    `+0x348`-indexed `0x8042C1A0` byte table shifted left by 11, and advances
///    to state `3`; otherwise it decrements the timer.
