///    by `0.6f`, rounds `+0xD14` to `+/-max(256, |angle|)`, then - when
///    `|+0xE8| < 2.0f` and `+0x102 != -1` - zeroes the three motion fields,
///    calls `+0x394` and advances to state `4`.
