/// - Ghidra: none - no `functions.tsv` row and no export file for `0x800A5BB0`.
/// - Extent: 1148 bytes, `0x800A5BB0..0x800A602C`; 12 zero bytes precede it and
///   4 zero bytes follow, then slot 173 at `0x800A6030`.
/// - Table: slot 171 of the `0x80313760` vtable (word `0x80313A14`, offset
///   `+0x2B4`).
/// - observed: `lwzu r12,r3,0x544` / `+0x1C`; `bl 0x80166280` with
///   `addi r3,r31,0x5BC`; the `+0x33C`/`+0x340` pair; then the
///   `cmpi`/`bc 12,2` chain on `+0x360` for `1`/`2`/`3`/`4`.
/// - observed state `1`: `0x8015F4F0(+0x102, 0, 0x1000)`, `addic.` on `+0xD1C`,
///   `+0x360 = 2`, `+0x2DC`, `lwz 0x5F8`, `lwz 4(r3)`, then `+0xD4` with
///   `0x80357AB4` on the owner and `0x80357F9C` on `this`.
/// - observed state `2`: `lhz +0xD14` / `lha +0x102` add and `sth`; `bl
///  0x800955F0`; `lwz 0(r31)`; `r13-0x5924`; `0x8006A4B0(r1+0x10, +0xAC)`;
///   `0x80198660(manager, 0x5AC, actor, point, 0)`; the `xoris`/`0x43300000`
///   conversion of `+0xD18` compared with `45.0f`.
/// - observed state `3`: the same prefix, then `fctiwz` stores of
///   `0.6f * +0xD14`, the `fneg`/`fcmpo` absolute value, the `256.0f` floor,
///   the `1.0f`/`-1.0f` sign select, `+0xE8 *= 0.6f`, `+0x374`, and the
///   `2.0f` gate before zeroing `+0xE8`, `+0xD14`, `+0x102`.
/// - observed state `4`: `+0x2DC` -> `lwzu r12,r3,0x394` -> `+0x28` ->
///   `+0x14` with `0x803579F4`; then `+0x2DC` -> `fn_80169020(owner+0x644)`
///   and the `0x80357E5C`/`0x803578F4` `+0xD4` pair.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor with the `+0x60` vtable, the `+0x544` motion object, the
///   `+0x5BC` animation array, the `+0xAC` position, the `+0x102`/`+0xD14`
///   phase pair and the `+0xE8`/`+0xEC` motion floats.
