///   zero halfwords and `*(u16 *)(this+0x104)` as the descriptor.
/// - observed: `fcmpo` against zero (absolute value of `+0x740`),
///   `fdivs` by `200.0f`, `fmuls` by `0.2f`, and the `0.02f` threshold.
/// - observed: `this+0x790 * 276 + 0xA34` through `0x802967e0`, the `+0xC`
///   mode compare against `1`/`2`, the `+0xA0` call with `0x80313728`, the
///   `+0x14` call plus the `(index+1) & 1` toggle, the two-iteration `+0x114`
