// Wave 269, lane B (`_B269`): closing the 46-slot `0x80315EF0` `Kinopio`
// panel vtable
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// The wave-268 handoff listed 36 covered / 10 uncovered / 0 prologue. A fresh
// scan at this lane's start measured 39 / 7 because wave-268 lane C had already
