// | 37 | `0x80315F84` | `+0x094` | `0x800BD750` | 8 | `_C269` in this file, [`fn_800bd750`] |
// | 38 | `0x80315F88` | `+0x098` | `0x800BD740` | 8 | `_C269` in this file, [`fn_800bd740`] |
// | 39 | `0x80315F8C` | `+0x09C` | `0x800BD730` | 8 | `_C269` in this file, [`fn_800bd730`] |
// | 40 | `0x80315F90` | `+0x0A0` | `0x800BD710` | 28 | `_C269` in this file, [`fn_800bd710`] |
// | 41 | `0x80315F94` | `+0x0A4` | `0x800BD6D0` | 4 | `_D269` in [`crate::engine::dsys`], [`crate::engine::dsys::fn_800bd6d0`] |
