// Wave 279 lane B (`_B279`) - `Wm_en_burst_big` close-out and the
// `Wm_en_burst_s` parent table `0x80315840` / methods `0x80315848`
// ===========================================================================
//
// The 17-slot table `0x80315778` is the derived method table of the
// big-hanachan burst element (`Wm_en_burst_big`, wave 278). Its parent,
// header `0x80315840` with methods `0x80315848..0x80315888`, is the small
// variant (`Wm_en_burst_s`); see the decode block below. Six of its seventeen
// words are shared with the child, so this lane translates the six leaves once
// and both tables read from the same bodies.
//
// Census reconciliation: the wave-266/272/276 table-start census recorded
// `0x80315848` as 13 uncovered with 7 prologue targets. Wave 278 translated
// five of those seven prologue targets (`0x800B7AC0`, `0x800B70F0`,
// `0x800B7290`, `0x800B6A80`, `0x800B6B50`) because they are also prologue
// slots of `0x80315778`. This lane's start scan therefore reads 9/17 covered,
// 8 uncovered: slots 1 and 7 (the two remaining prologue bodies) plus slots
// 2, 3, 4, 11, 14 and 16 (the six shared leaves). All eight are translated
// below, which completes both tables.
//
// ## `0x80315848` decode
//
// | item | value |
// |---|---|
// | vtable header | `0x80315840` = `{0x00000000, 0x00000000}` |
// | method array | `0x80315848..0x80315888` (17 slots, 68 B) |
// | slot 0 / slot 16 | `0x800B7C50` / `0x800B6680` |
// | terminator | `0x8031588C = 0`, which doubles as the zero header of the next table (`0x8031588C`, methods `0x80315894`) |
// | preceding record | `0x80315830` = `+0x278` record of the child: `{0x800B7C10, 0x8002A220, 0x800B76E0, 0x80026120}` |
//
// ### Install site
//
// No main-DOL text materialises `0x80315840`; the live installers are both in
// `d_enemiesNP` (sweep of every ELF with `work/wave278/b_install4.mjs`, this
// lane's rerun in `work/wave279/b_install.txt`):
//
// ```text
// 0x80A0F680: 3E808031  lis  r20,0x8031
// 0x80A0F6B8: 3A945840  addi r20,r20,0x5840   ; -> 0x80315840
// 0x80A0F804: 929C0000  stw  r20,0(r28)       ; middle layer of the big variant
// 0x80A0F83C: 92FC0000  stw  r23,0(r28)       ; r23 = 0x80315770 (child layer)
//
// 0x80A70878: 3F008031  lis  r24,0x8031
// 0x80A708C0: 3B185840  addi r24,r24,0x5840   ; -> 0x80315840
// 0x80A709EC: 931E0000  stw  r24,0(r30)       ; final layer of the small variant
