///
/// `stages` is the base of the four-object array (the callers pass
/// `0x80429E98`). For `course = 0..4` the body calls [`parse_course_file`] with
/// `stages + course * 0x3B0` and the 0-based course index; the parser itself
/// appends `+1` when it formats `course/course<N>.bin`.
///
