/// - Ghidra: none - no `functions.tsv` row and no export file for `0x8008EC40`.
/// - Extent: `0x8008EC40..0x8008EC90` (80 bytes, 19 instructions), ending at
///   the `blr` at `0x8008EC8C`; one zero word precedes it at `0x8008EC3C`
///   (after [`fn_8008ebe0`]) and the next documented extent starts at
///   `0x8008ED70`.
/// - Reach: no `b` or `bl` in the executable segments targets it, and no data
///   word names it.
/// - Observed: `stwu r1,-0x10(r1)`; `mflr r0`; `stw r0,0x14(r1)`;
///   `stw r31,0xC(r1)`; `mr r31,r3`; `stw r30,0x8(r1)`; `li r30,0`;
///   `mr r3,r31`; `mr r4,r30`; `bl 0x8008DFF0`; `addi r30,r30,1`;
///   `addi r31,r31,0x3B0`; `2C1E0004 cmpi cr0,0,r30,4`;
